      "@id": "kt:alpha-beta-pruning",
      "@type": "kto:Algorithm",
      "skos:prefLabel": "Alpha-beta pruning",
      "skos:definition": "A refinement of minimax game-tree search that skips branches which provably cannot change the value of the root, letting a chess engine reach the same result as full minimax while examining far fewer positions.",
