      "@id": "kt:en-passant",
      "@type": "kto:Rule",
      "skos:prefLabel": "En passant",
      "skos:definition": "The special pawn capture in which a pawn that has just advanced two squares from its starting square, landing beside an enemy pawn, may be taken by that pawn as though it had moved only one square; the capture is legal only on the very next move.",
